@name     pattern_copy
@alias    ycp
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_pattern_copy
@type     immediate
@arity    2
@match    (finite, finite)
@summary  copy pattern to another pattern slot
@doc
Copies all steps, timing, settings, and code from source pattern to destination pattern.
Usage: src dst ycp (or pattern_copy src dst)
@code
    (void)ctx; (void)s; (void)argc;
    return seq_pattern_copy((int)args[0], (int)args[1]);
@end
